@startuml sequence_diagram_put
skinparam handwritten true
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rect
skinparam defaultFontName FG Virgil
skinparam shadowing false

actor User as Actor
participant "U I" as UI <<presentation>>
participant BackEnd as BackEnd <<C4 Container>>
database Database

title Update Xpto

Actor --> UI: Update Xpto
activate UI

    UI --> BackEnd: HTTP PUT /api/xpto/{id}

    activate BackEnd

        BackEnd --> Database: SELECT (where id = id)
        activate Database
            Database --> BackEnd : xptoInstance?
        deactivate Database

        group if xptoInstance is null
        BackEnd --> UI: HTTP Response
        UI --> Actor: Error\n(xpto does not exist)
        end

        BackEnd --> Database : UPDATE (new xpto data)
        activate Database
            Database --> BackEnd : updated xpto
        deactivate Database

        BackEnd --> UI: HTTP Response
    deactivate BackEnd

UI --> Actor: Display updated xpto
deactivate UI
            
@enduml